BANO KA THA BAYAN MERI BACHI GUZARGAYI <br>
 GODI MEIN MAA KE HICHKIYA LE LE KE MARGAYI<br>
<br>
1. SHASHMAH E BE ZUBAN ALI ASGHER KO ROO CHUKI <br>
 HUM SHAKHLE MUSTAFA ALI AKBER KO ROO CHUKI <br>
 ABBAS E NAAMDAR KO SARWAR KO ROO CHUKI <br>
 ZINDAAN ME ROTE ROTE SAKINA GUZARGAYI<br>
<br>
2. IS KAMSINI MEIN DAAGH E YATIMI UTHAYI HAI <br>
 BABA KE GHAME ME KHOON KE AANSOO BAHAYE HAI <br>
 HAR ZULM SEH KE SHAAM KE ZINDAAN ME AAYI HAI<br>
 SADME UTHA UTHA KE SAKINA GUZARGAYI<br>
<br>
3. SAJJAD ASHK BAAR HAI ZAINAB HAI SOUGHWAAR <br>
 MARQAD ME ROO HE FATIMA ZEHRA HAI BEQARAR <br>
 BANO TADAP KE KEHTI HAI ZINDAAN ME BAAR BAAR <br>
 SEENE PE SOONE WALI SAKINA GUZAR GAYI<br>
<br>
4. SUMHRE LAYEE'N KE ZULM O SITAM WA MUSIBATA <br>
 NANNE SE DIL PE RANJO ALAM WA MUSIBATA <br>
 MAYYAT PE RO RAHE HAI HARAM WA MUSIBATA <br>
